    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the chaos of <strong>Burger Takeout</strong>, <strong>a co-op roguelike simulator</strong>! Each day, orders need to be prepared faster, and more customers arrive. Earn money, upgrade your restaurant, and buy items that help or hinder you at different stages. Spend wisely and use perks strategically\u2014they can save you or make things worse! Experiment with tactics to survive in this ruthless business, where every mistake could cost you everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize and Evolve Your Restaurant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each</strong> <strong>style has unique themes and special items</strong>, both decorative and interactive. Purchasing them raises your style level, unlocking new buffs and debuffs. Depending on the game stage, every item can have different effects\u2014so choose wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/95272143bda4691d8b3e1a536542d346.poster.avif?t=1754087696\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/95272143bda4691d8b3e1a536542d346.webm?t=1754087696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/95272143bda4691d8b3e1a536542d346.mp4?t=1754087696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Changing Weather &amp; Time of Day</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather affects gameplay</strong> in various ways\u2014guests moods, tips, and restaurant cleanliness all change depending on conditions. Time of day and weather also alter the environment, making the world feel more immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/3e02b514cad90593fb9453569f8556b8.poster.avif?t=1754087696\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/3e02b514cad90593fb9453569f8556b8.webm?t=1754087696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/3e02b514cad90593fb9453569f8556b8.mp4?t=1754087696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Random Events</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earthquakes, zero gravity, and slippery floors</strong> shake up gameplay. These events appear for a limited time and can disrupt or even benefit your workflow, depending on your strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/ca177e839d510abbc3c0881d5624d44d.poster.avif?t=1754087696\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/ca177e839d510abbc3c0881d5624d44d.webm?t=1754087696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/ca177e839d510abbc3c0881d5624d44d.mp4?t=1754087696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight Off Pests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cockroaches appear in unsanitary conditions</strong>, multiplying rapidly and swarming the restaurant. They scare guests and lower ratings. <strong>Rats steal food</strong>, so stay alert and keep an eye on the floor. You can fight pests yourself or call a disinfection service\u2014if you can afford it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/52d8d56390befbf4c31ea7021be836c3.poster.avif?t=1754087696\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/52d8d56390befbf4c31ea7021be836c3.webm?t=1754087696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/52d8d56390befbf4c31ea7021be836c3.mp4?t=1754087696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Serve Your Guests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grill, assemble, and serve quickly</strong>\u2014slow service can lead to failure! <strong>The faster you work, the more money you make</strong>, the higher your rating, and the better the chance of boosting customer mood. The pace increases every day, so efficient teamwork is key!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/1925d7e7e71793e4d0cde70a1b4edca0.poster.avif?t=1754087696\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/1925d7e7e71793e4d0cde70a1b4edca0.webm?t=1754087696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/1925d7e7e71793e4d0cde70a1b4edca0.mp4?t=1754087696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dive Into The Dynamic Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your restaurant by purchasing new items and themes, increasing your chances of success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose restaurant perks wisely and use player perks to gain an advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources and expenses\u2014run out of money, and you won\u2019t be able to buy ingredients, ending the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome challenges: pests, fires, and kitchen messes will keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to unexpected events that can change the course of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience two game modes: <strong>Career</strong> for progression and challenges, or <strong>Sandbox</strong> for creativity and freedom.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the chaos of <strong>Burger Takeout</strong>, <strong>a co-op roguelike simulator</strong>! Each day, orders need to be prepared faster, and more customers arrive. Earn money, upgrade your restaurant, and buy items that help or hinder you at different stages. Spend wisely and use perks strategically\u2014they can save you or make things worse! Experiment with tactics to survive in this ruthless business, where every mistake could cost you everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize and Evolve Your Restaurant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each</strong> <strong>style has unique themes and special items</strong>, both decorative and interactive. Purchasing them raises your style level, unlocking new buffs and debuffs. Depending on the game stage, every item can have different effects\u2014so choose wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/95272143bda4691d8b3e1a536542d346.poster.avif?t=1754087696\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/95272143bda4691d8b3e1a536542d346.webm?t=1754087696\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753940/extras/95272143bda4691d8b3e1a536542d346.mp4?t=1754087696\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Changing Weather &amp; Time of Day</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather affects gameplay</strong> in various ways\u2014guests moods, tips, and restaurant cleanliness all change depending on conditions. Time of day and weather also alter the environment, making the world feel more immersive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop 