you won\u2019t be able to buy ingredients, ending the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome challenges: pests, fires, and kitchen messes will keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to unexpected events that can change the course of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience two game modes: <strong>Career</strong> for progression and challenges, or <strong>Sandbox</strong> for creativity and freedom.</p></li></ul>",
